{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d53e2681850eb2f27ffa05bb136bcbc1ddb0cbce1728c368aaff32bc18710fa", "ja": "（ひなたのPV撮影が終わった。雪景色の中で歌う姿が\nひなたの柔らかい雰囲気と合ってて、よかったな……）", "zh": "（日向的PV拍摄结束了。她在雪景中歌唱的身影，和她柔和的气质十分相称，真是太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "455671d930193e28b67eee25e4cd31ce48f01a908a4f4e0c79b229cf0a01e884", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\n今日は楽しい撮影ができて、よかったべさ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n今天能进行愉快的拍摄，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "f6b0c57ee26230da7266ef550f91aa8c335c99a91574657d46f553c1417cc1dd", "ja": "緊張とか、なんも気にならなくってねぇ。\n昨日、弟と電話したからかなぁ？", "zh": "紧张什么的，完全没觉得有什么呢。可能是因为昨天和弟弟打了电话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0ec174cb836fff8c0933a553974201760aa1c45c6fcd2e169c51ae6548b13197", "ja": "そうだったのか。いつもよりリラックスしてるなと\n思ってたけど、弟さんのおかげだったんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。我就觉得你比平时放松，没想到是多亏了你弟弟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "34c6d56bc894cd277a45b4b907b99e767ecb28e088b7f2693c32fbc7bdb64409", "ja": "えへへ。大した用じゃなかったんだけど……\nそん時に、ちょっこし昔のことを話してねぇ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，也不是什么大事……就是那时候，稍微聊了聊以前的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "7f1a7e264e730782bbb2a4219ba05baad299e1ca248b40f22c9e5697d495a671", "ja": "雪がすごい日は、家の中から外を見たり、\n晴れた日は、外でたくさん足跡をつけたり……。", "zh": "下大雪的日子，就从屋里看着外面；天晴的时候，就在外面留下好多脚印……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "f5f8e0e34b53cc2f44c1afafe59eb369a6d5350b0ebe28399b10fb8dba5ad29f", "ja": "雪だるまを作るのに夢中で、手が真っ赤になった時は\nばあちゃんに心配かけちゃったねって……。", "zh": "专心堆雪人，手都变得通红的时候，还让奶奶担心了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1007_p", "source_sha256": "48b391ce83465842b37d431303cb8edab88e3bfe91cf8e1a42efac288f5ef07c", "ja": "弟さんとの温かい思い出だな。\nそんな話をしてたなら、確かに緊張も解れそうだ。", "zh": "真是和弟弟的温馨回忆啊。\n聊着那样的事，确实也能让人放松下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "e5a7ddd551b67841b692421d3c3d07b1ebb2d8b2fe8f3b122e242e0fd9470c9e", "ja": "うん。それでね、弟がこんなことを言ってたんだぁ。\nアイドルのこと、あんまり知らなかったけど……。", "zh": "嗯。然后呢，弟弟还说了这样的话哦。\n虽然以前不太了解偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "7798f2be07a461f0ad505ebc1eb0ca48e8de4eeeef24e80fead2218ae7c4a15e", "ja": "いろんなところにアイドルがいるんだねって。\nあたしがアイドルになってから、気づいたみたい。", "zh": "原来到处都有偶像啊。\n他好像是我当了偶像之后才注意到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "0e0808ffd60de0a695ba3d76649c2e162f29e331e9a3aeacfc36610bf02e017a", "ja": "弟のクラスでも、あたしの話がでるんだって聞いて\n恥ずかしさもあったけど……でも、嬉しかったんだ。", "zh": "听说连弟弟的班上也会聊起我的事，\n虽然觉得有点不好意思……但还是很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d05a145b9d622c20606e5fe0875d9836a0b1be0ee12f22dd7fb72023f15e3cda", "ja": "ははっ。ひなたのスカウトがきっかけで\nアイドルについて知ってもらえて、よかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈。多亏了挖掘小日向，我也很高兴能让他开始了解偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e59011b9b1cb5631df508f158d51f930a684aee760d22e33b3762b95e63894a8", "ja": "なんだか、懐かしいな。社長に呼び出されて、\n急いで向かった先で、ひなたと出会ったんだ。", "zh": "不知怎么的，真让人怀念啊。那时被社长叫去，急匆匆赶过去后，就遇见了日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "2e34d74968588c4ab0c6a2a0511750db15c5e8ef2cc8acf5a3f164c1c2b9eefd", "ja": "そうだねぇ。あたしも、自分がアイドルになるなんて\n考えたこともなかったよぉ。", "zh": "是啊。我也从没想过自己居然会成为偶像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "f99a0e25ee1db70d88c6f58ea0ba38a0c4629f9563d8cee96855f9f4f6d7e59c", "ja": "キラキラした衣装とか、ステージに憧れてたけど、\n違う世界を見ている気分だったからねぇ。", "zh": "虽然憧憬着闪闪发亮的服装和舞台，但总觉得那是属于另一个世界的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fc51e2b3b3d538896d241b5e6a4355b88b3b86ad78639dece9ba16cd578c0417", "ja": "でも今は立派なアイドルの一人だ！\nステージ以外にも、演技や地元の大使まで……。", "zh": "但现在，你已经是个出色的偶像了！除了舞台活动，还涉足演戏，甚至担任家乡大使……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dcda9e1da158266af69711c6c723da6f66e999a31d8a3dde5149de35d41944b4", "ja": "どれも、現実の出来事だよ。\n憧れていた世界に、今、ひなたは立っているんだ。", "zh": "这些全都是现实中发生过的事。\n现在，阳向正站在自己憧憬的那个世界里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "39591022211c8873e616f8e2a570da0904cf85fb417c6ff31d1e817dba56aefa", "ja": "えへへ……。だからね、弟にも言ったんだわ。\n小さい頃のあたしも、きっと喜んでるよって。", "zh": "嘿嘿……所以啊，我也对弟弟说了。\n小时候的我，一定也会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "5c27e4b553896f6e491aabb6c8368a23f41d0a118fa77cb400f478c48c1633f8", "ja": "将来、アイドルになってるよって教えたら、\nうんと驚いた後、笑顔になるに違いないべさ。", "zh": "要是告诉她将来会成为偶像，\n她肯定会吓一大跳，然后笑逐颜开吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d58b9a874715de843ba8a503ba92244a8f8d4c21d0d7dcad8d067e99e16b248e", "ja": "ああ。でも、まだ満足するのは早いかもな。\nアイドルの世界……芸能界は広い！", "zh": "啊。不过现在就满足还为时尚早。\n偶像的世界……演艺圈可是很广阔的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e96a4fa734be0e60c9fcdaac999b0c6551d3ab89cb8ebfddce85146ef51c7ecb", "ja": "これからのひなたには、もっと大きな舞台に立つ\nチャンスが待ってると思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，今后的日向还会有机会登上更大的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe2372b5191da894490bd18103c9df039d6e83ed8db311f39b7d6983d8d029c0", "ja": "なら、もっともっと成長しないといけないねぇ。\n昔のあたしに、恥ずかしい姿は見せられないもの。", "zh": "那就必须继续不断成长才行呢。可不能让过去的我看到丢脸的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "2acd405f891bf69cdf6c3ef5da4b38618bd9a94b2d09b9a1510eb36e460afc0d", "ja": "あたしの……アイドルが好きっていう気持ちを\n大切にして。もっともっと、頑張るべさ！", "zh": "请珍惜我喜欢偶像的这份心情。\n我要更加更加努力啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0624_1023_p", "source_sha256": "943a11f901843882e4ce954fe9e8c30adf425499077c6252f4b7ffed622ed6aa", "ja": "（幼い頃のひなたが見る、今のひなたは、きっと眩く\n輝いている。輝きを絶やさないために支えないとな）", "zh": "年幼时的日向看到现在的日向，一定会觉得她耀眼夺目吧。为了让这份光芒不熄灭，我也得好好支持她才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
